WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.863 --> 00:00:12.296
Kyle looked around his new room.

2
00:00:12.297 --> 00:00:15.937
His sleeping bag lay on the empty floor.

3
00:00:15.938 --> 00:00:21.108
"I hope the moving truck comes soon," he thought.

4
00:00:21.109 --> 00:00:24.216
Kyle went down to the kitchen.

5
00:00:24.217 --> 00:00:29.063
He opened the refrigerator and found it was empty too.

6
00:00:29.064 --> 00:00:31.991
"Ugh," said Kyle.

7
00:00:31.992 --> 00:00:34.887
His mom walked in with a box.

8
00:00:34.888 --> 00:00:38.370
Kyle heard dishes rattling inside.

9
00:00:38.371 --> 00:00:42.424
"We'll go grocery shopping later," she said.

10
00:00:42.425 --> 00:00:45.631
"Why don't you play outside for now?

11
00:00:45.632 --> 00:00:48.284
Maybe you'll make a friend."

12
00:00:48.285 --> 00:00:55.300
Kyle went outside and walked down the sidewalk.

13
00:00:55.301 --> 00:00:57.265
He found a park.

14
00:00:57.266 --> 00:01:00.984
But the place was empty.

15
00:01:00.985 --> 00:01:03.819
"This stinks," he thought.

16
00:01:03.820 --> 00:01:06.513
"Hi," said a voice.

17
00:01:06.514 --> 00:01:11.469
"Huh?" Kyle looked around, but he didn't see anybody.

18
00:01:11.470 --> 00:01:14.150
"Who said that?"

19
00:01:14.151 --> 00:01:17.348
"I did," said the voice.

20
00:01:17.349 --> 00:01:19.508
Kyle spun around.

21
00:01:19.509 --> 00:01:23.361
The voice was coming from a tall oak tree!

22
00:01:23.362 --> 00:01:27.586
"A talking tree?" said Kyle.

23
00:01:27.587 --> 00:01:30.632
"That's right," said the tree.

24
00:01:30.633 --> 00:01:32.918
"Want to be friends?"

25
00:01:32.919 --> 00:01:36.049
Kyle scratched his head.

26
00:01:36.050 --> 00:01:39.794
"How can we be friends?" he asked.

27
00:01:39.795 --> 00:01:44.865
"I'm a person, and you're a tree!"

28
00:01:44.866 --> 00:01:46.612
"Does it matter?

29
00:01:46.613 --> 00:01:52.477
By the way, I like cats," said the tree. "Do you?"

30
00:01:52.478 --> 00:01:55.699
"Yes," said Kyle.

31
00:01:55.700 --> 00:02:01.125
"I like playing soccer," said the tree. "Do you?"

32
00:02:01.126 --> 00:02:06.201
Kyle couldn't imagine a tree playing soccer.

33
00:02:06.202 --> 00:02:10.895
But he answered the question because he wanted to be polite.

34
00:02:10.896 --> 00:02:15.819
"Yes, I love soccer," he said.

35
00:02:15.820 --> 00:02:19.521
"I'm in fourth grade," said the tree.

36
00:02:19.522 --> 00:02:21.721
"What grade are you in?"

37
00:02:21.722 --> 00:02:25.729
"I'm in fourth grade too!" said Kyle.

38
00:02:25.730 --> 00:02:31.929
"But how can a tree go to school?"

39
00:02:31.930 --> 00:02:35.797
"Climb up and find out," said the tree.

40
00:02:35.798 --> 00:02:40.482
Kyle grabbed a branch and climbed up.

41
00:02:40.483 --> 00:02:46.953
A girl was chuckling on a branch.

42
00:02:46.954 --> 00:02:51.329
"Hi," she said. "I'm Pearl.

43
00:02:51.330 --> 00:02:56.156
I like cats and soccer and . . . climbing trees."

44
00:02:56.157 --> 00:03:00.839
Kyle laughed.

45
00:03:00.840 --> 00:03:04.303
He had a new friend!
